#: ../../source/user_guide/forms.rst:12 7f74baea8a344c95ba9a293f973d4ea0
msgid ""
"The bilinear form :math:`a(u, v)` becomes a stiffness matrix; the linear "
"form :math:`l(v)` becomes a load vector. In TensorMesh you write each "
"integrand as a single Python function and the library handles quadrature, "
"geometry, and the global scatter into a sparse matrix or vector. This is the"
" layer most users interact with — once you have worked through this page you"
" can express almost any FEM weak form in a few lines of Python."
msgstr ""
"双线性形式 :math:`a(u, v)` 对应刚度矩阵；线性形式 :math:`l(v)` 对应载荷向量。在 TensorMesh "
"中，你只需把每个被积函数写成一个 Python "
"函数，库会自动处理数值积分、几何以及向稀疏矩阵或向量的全局散布（scatter）。这是大多数用户打交道的那一层——读完本页后，你就能用几行 Python"
" 表达几乎任意有限元弱形式。"

