"``point_data`` 的键，你还可以通过在名称前加上 ``\"grad\"`` 前缀来请求其梯度——无需任何额外的传递设置。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/forms.rst:429 c328976051344333be7aadaa572cb7c1
msgid ""
"Per-(element, quadrature) ``element_data`` is auto-detected only by "
"``ElementAssembler.energy`` (see :ref:`forms-energy`), not by the matrix-"
"assembling ``ElementAssembler.__call__`` path. If you pass a tensor of shape"
" ``[n_elem, n_quad, ...]`` to ``__call__``, the *whole* ``[n_quad, ...]`` "
"slice is handed to ``forward`` for each element — not the per-quadrature "
"value. For matrix assembly today, keep ``element_data`` strictly per-"
"element."
msgstr ""
"随（单元，求积点）变化的 ``element_data`` 仅由 ``ElementAssembler.energy`` 自动识别（参见 "
":ref:`forms-energy`\\ ），装配矩阵的 ``ElementAssembler.__call__`` 路径并不识别。如果你向 "
"``__call__`` 传入形状为 ``[n_elem, n_quad, ...]`` 的张量，那么对每个单元交给 ``forward`` 的将是 "
"*整个* ``[n_quad, ...]`` 切片——而非逐求积点的值。就目前的矩阵装配而言，请把 ``element_data`` "
"严格保持为逐单元的形式。"

